@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 70 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "Receipts" as R
concise "Batch" as B
concise "Instance" as I

@0
R is "r1"
B is "open (batch N)"
I is "idle"

@1
R is "r2"

@2
R is "latch"
B is "N closed"
I is "evaluate N"

@3
R is "r3"

@4
I is "commit + dispatch N"

@5
R is "r4"

@6
R is "latch"
B is "N+1 closed: r3, r4"
I is "evaluate N+1"

@7
R is "-"
I is "idle"

B@2 <-> @6 : r3 and r4 arrive after latch -> they wait for N+1
@enduml
